        </exercise>
      </example>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated" id="list-00002">
        <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the data that represents the population projections for this scenario.</item>
      </list>
      <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500" height="400"/><example id="exam-00002">
        <exercise>
